{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1012302001:0":{"text":"What is this blasted thing? It's so scary!","source_cn":"这到底是什么东西？它长得太吓人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x285B76DEB9DD0D3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012302002:0":{"text":"They appeared with the butterflies. Maybe there's a connection.","source_cn":"它们两次伴随着黑色蝴蝶出现，而雅顿老师让我们跟着蝴蝶，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x072282E22F244CB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012302003:0":{"text":"Should we just follow the blue ones? They're Misarte's messengers.","source_cn":"非得跟着蝴蝶吗？那起码跟着蓝色闪蝶吧……至少它们是弥萨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A0FCDBDB42E872F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012302004:0":{"text":"Stop complaining. This could be the only way to Ivoryshade.","source_cn":"别抱怨了，这或许是前往月影乡的唯一方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BF91B54F880F280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"Lorsan","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"Bryon","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"Lyca","source":"莱卡","s